WEBVTT

00:00:13.830 --> 00:00:15.000
Not yet.

00:00:15.710 --> 00:00:17.580
You can't turn over your exams yet, okay?

00:00:23.710 --> 00:00:27.440
I beg you, I beg you, I beg you, I beg you...

00:00:27.440 --> 00:00:29.170
Okay, begin!

00:00:40.610 --> 00:00:42.980
Only one more day of painful examinations...

00:00:43.640 --> 00:00:47.120
Once it is over, it'll be the long-awaited summer vacation.

00:00:48.110 --> 00:00:50.980
Look, turn around now

00:00:51.360 --> 00:00:55.320
but things like chances won't be there anymore.

00:00:55.780 --> 00:00:59.780
That's what some people will tell you,

00:01:00.370 --> 00:01:06.040
but there are just times when you can't move at all.

00:01:12.590 --> 00:01:15.510
Yes, everything I say

00:01:16.050 --> 00:01:19.970
is for your sake.

00:01:20.560 --> 00:01:22.470
Sorry, but

00:01:22.810 --> 00:01:24.770
I won't consent easily

00:01:25.020 --> 00:01:30.650
to things I don't accept.

00:01:32.320 --> 00:01:37.660
Even if I can get by that moment with a lie

00:01:37.660 --> 00:01:40.740
I'll end up regretting it afterwards.

00:01:41.330 --> 00:01:43.540
Whether it's the past or the future

00:01:43.540 --> 00:01:45.620
or, of course, the present,

00:01:45.710 --> 00:01:50.040
I am the one that has to shoulder it.

00:01:50.290 --> 00:01:54.710
You'll understand the meaning to everything afterwards.

00:01:50.290 --> 00:01:53.340
So let's worry!

00:01:54.760 --> 00:01:58.970
even if you don't understand them now,

00:01:59.260 --> 00:02:03.640
whether it has to do with pain, fortune or secrets.

00:02:03.720 --> 00:02:08.020
So don't cry, let's hold each other as we go

00:02:08.190 --> 00:02:11.520
forever-

00:02:11.610 --> 00:02:17.280
It's My Life dakara

00:02:11.610 --> 00:02:17.280
because it's my life.

00:02:15.940 --> 00:02:15.990
last frame of Manabi Straight! logo

00:02:19.500 --> 00:02:21.830
Man, this is really useful.

00:02:22.060 --> 00:02:24.010
For this to only cost 250 yen, cheap!

00:02:24.010 --> 00:02:25.050
Too cheap!

00:02:25.610 --> 00:02:30.090
If people could get good grades just by rolling that pencil, then life wouldn't be so harsh.

00:02:30.640 --> 00:02:31.930
Tsk, tsk.

00:02:31.930 --> 00:02:34.030
That's where you're wrong, Mei-chan,

00:02:34.030 --> 00:02:39.560
for this pencil was made from the sacred trees on Mt. Fuji.

00:02:39.560 --> 00:02:41.120
Hmm...

00:02:41.120 --> 00:02:42.600
That's what the shrine workers said!

00:02:42.860 --> 00:02:44.060
Ahh...

00:02:46.300 --> 00:02:47.780
Made in China.

00:02:50.420 --> 00:02:51.780
Dude, notice that.

00:02:53.020 --> 00:02:54.830
I-It can't be...

00:02:55.140 --> 00:02:57.780
Th-There's a Mt. Fuji in China, too!

00:02:57.780 --> 00:02:59.450
No, there isn't.

00:03:00.450 --> 00:03:01.630
Darn, it's hot...

00:03:03.070 --> 00:03:06.720
We can't rely on the gods or guess what's on the test after all...

00:03:06.720 --> 00:03:08.920
We should just study and work hard...

00:03:08.920 --> 00:03:11.400
I'll have to pull an all-nighter tonight...

00:03:11.400 --> 00:03:13.930
Do you know what we call that?

00:03:13.930 --> 00:03:17.100
"Do your best and leave the rest to fate."

00:03:17.100 --> 00:03:18.860
Will you be doing your best, Mu-chi?

00:03:18.860 --> 00:03:19.750
I will not!

00:03:20.200 --> 00:03:21.870
And that's okay with you?

00:03:23.350 --> 00:03:25.440
As no one cares about semester examinations,

00:03:25.440 --> 00:03:30.360
preparations for the School Fair are gradually moving forward as we head into Summer vacation.

00:03:32.730 --> 00:03:34.720
A secret pamphlet, it says.

00:03:34.720 --> 00:03:35.710
What'll we do?

00:03:37.650 --> 00:03:38.470
What's this?

00:03:39.580 --> 00:03:40.710
Hmm...

00:03:40.180 --> 00:03:41.990
They're doing something interesting.

00:03:40.710 --> 00:03:41.800
This is pretty good.

00:03:42.170 --> 00:03:42.620
Huh?

00:03:43.520 --> 00:03:47.810
Manabi-chan's idea was to grab everyone's attention.

00:03:49.920 --> 00:03:53.350
And this website was Mei-chan's wonderful work.

00:03:54.070 --> 00:03:56.440
And basically, this is how it works.

00:04:00.450 --> 00:04:02.800
They enter the data into this form.

00:04:02.800 --> 00:04:05.320
I've made it so that it can reflect the information on the website,

00:04:05.320 --> 00:04:09.140
and so we can monitor the progress of the School Fair in real time.

00:04:09.140 --> 00:04:10.510
Wow!

00:04:10.510 --> 00:04:11.520
This is perfect!

00:04:11.520 --> 00:04:12.850
Mei-chan, you're a genius!

00:04:14.900 --> 00:04:16.700
Anyway, I made this site in a hurry,

00:04:16.700 --> 00:04:18.120
so I'm open to your suggestions.

00:04:24.770 --> 00:04:25.930
San Diego!

00:04:25.930 --> 00:04:26.830
G-Gorilla!

00:04:26.830 --> 00:04:28.090
La... Rapper!

00:04:28.090 --> 00:04:28.910
Pantsu!

00:04:28.910 --> 00:04:29.910
Ahh!!

00:04:37.010 --> 00:04:39.810
The website was redesigned and redesigned.

00:04:41.020 --> 00:04:42.520
This looks interesting!

00:04:42.520 --> 00:04:44.530
Can we have personal exhibits, too?

00:04:44.530 --> 00:04:45.690
It's written on the pamphlet.

00:04:45.690 --> 00:04:47.950
Umm... yeah, they allow that.

00:04:47.950 --> 00:04:50.120
But, what should I do?

00:04:50.120 --> 00:04:53.990
Basically, anything is fine as long as it's under budget,

00:04:53.990 --> 00:04:56.860
and it takes three days for the school to approve, so fly to the website before-

00:04:57.110 --> 00:04:58.570
"Fly to the website before looking"?

00:04:58.850 --> 00:05:01.090
Anyway, I've submitted a form!

00:05:01.430 --> 00:05:02.720
Really?!

00:05:02.720 --> 00:05:05.310
We'll need to submit a confirmation again the day after summer vacation ends,

00:05:05.310 --> 00:05:07.890
and that's when we'll really decide if we're doing it or not.

00:05:07.890 --> 00:05:10.040
Then maybe I'll submit something, too.

00:05:10.550 --> 00:05:11.590
Me, too!

00:05:11.590 --> 00:05:12.440
Me, too!

00:05:12.440 --> 00:05:16.370
The fifty pamphlets that we prepared ran out right away.

00:05:16.370 --> 00:05:19.550
Demand was so high that we had to spend all night making new ones.

00:05:21.770 --> 00:05:23.480
It seems to be going well.

00:05:24.100 --> 00:05:26.560
The Student Council officers are all working hard.

00:05:26.950 --> 00:05:28.660
I must say beforehand, Sensei,

00:05:29.100 --> 00:05:34.540
that I won't give approval to dangerous plans or ones that aren't part of a student's nature.

00:05:34.540 --> 00:05:36.650
And then there's the opera group's issue.

00:05:40.290 --> 00:05:42.770
It's a long-running tradition.

00:05:43.260 --> 00:05:46.170
I'm not saying we're officially terminating that,

00:05:46.170 --> 00:05:48.130
but whether or not we'll do that...

00:05:48.130 --> 00:05:50.490
...will greatly change the landscape of the budget distribution.

00:05:51.510 --> 00:05:53.790
Ah, yes, but-

00:05:54.230 --> 00:05:55.040
Umm...

00:05:55.400 --> 00:05:58.830
The students appear to be really looking forward to this,

00:05:58.830 --> 00:06:00.240
and when I see that-

00:06:00.240 --> 00:06:02.140
Well, how should I put it?

00:06:02.880 --> 00:06:03.850
It's getting you excited?

00:06:05.830 --> 00:06:06.540
Yes!

00:06:10.800 --> 00:06:11.980
I feel the same way.

00:06:15.900 --> 00:06:18.570
Let us try to think optimistically as much as we can!

00:06:24.620 --> 00:06:25.710
I'm done.

00:06:27.430 --> 00:06:30.000
If you click on the same character...

00:06:30.220 --> 00:06:31.120
You did it!

00:06:31.830 --> 00:06:33.710
Kyuuunnn...

00:06:33.710 --> 00:06:37.230
You get a point for passing a certain high score.

00:06:37.230 --> 00:06:42.240
And using those points, you can purchase a special avatar on the website or...

00:06:42.240 --> 00:06:45.980
...well, you guys take care of coming up with those ideas,

00:06:45.980 --> 00:06:49.120
and I'll make it so that everyone can play it on their PDAs,

00:06:49.120 --> 00:06:52.180
so before we make the game public, we'll have enough test playing-

00:06:52.180 --> 00:06:53.420
You did it!

00:06:53.420 --> 00:06:55.260
Kyuuunnn...

00:06:53.870 --> 00:06:54.730
*bow* *bow*

00:06:57.870 --> 00:06:58.820
You did it!

00:06:58.820 --> 00:07:00.570
Kyuuunnn...

00:07:01.630 --> 00:07:02.630
You did it!

00:07:02.960 --> 00:07:05.070
Kyuuunnn...

00:07:04.220 --> 00:07:05.650
*bow* *bow*

00:07:05.750 --> 00:07:08.540
Are you guys prepared for tomorrow's exam?

00:07:09.330 --> 00:07:10.640
*bow* *bow*

00:07:11.100 --> 00:07:12.570
*bow* *bow*

00:07:12.880 --> 00:07:14.190
*bow* *bow*

00:07:16.080 --> 00:07:17.110
Bye then!

00:07:17.110 --> 00:07:19.170
All-nighter, fight-o!

00:07:20.580 --> 00:07:21.890
Oh my god, it's hot.

00:07:21.890 --> 00:07:23.580
Mei-tan, are you sensitive to heat?

00:07:23.580 --> 00:07:25.410
Ah, I think she is!

00:07:26.680 --> 00:07:27.890
Mikan,

00:07:27.890 --> 00:07:29.030
I'm going.

00:07:30.180 --> 00:07:31.120
Hey~

00:07:31.120 --> 00:07:32.400
Mikan~

00:07:33.200 --> 00:07:34.350
Are you listening?

00:07:35.790 --> 00:07:37.130
Ah, sorry!

00:07:37.560 --> 00:07:39.720
How about getting some ice cream on the way back?

00:07:39.720 --> 00:07:41.030
Agreed!

00:07:41.030 --> 00:07:44.480
I've never won anything from
the ice cream bars in that store.

00:07:43.700 --> 00:07:45.500
Oh, no~

00:08:28.610 --> 00:08:30.560
Damn, it's hot...

00:08:33.100 --> 00:08:35.790
We could've just eaten inside if you think it's hot.

00:08:36.270 --> 00:08:38.180
Man, you don't get it.

00:08:38.180 --> 00:08:42.280
Eating ice cream in the heat
is what summer should feel like.

00:08:42.280 --> 00:08:43.640
I see.

00:08:43.640 --> 00:08:45.380
Yep, yep.

00:08:45.380 --> 00:08:49.710
Hey, hey, so what're the "secret surprise coupons"?

00:08:49.710 --> 00:08:51.450
Will something good happen if I collect them?

00:08:51.450 --> 00:08:52.520
I don't know.

00:08:52.730 --> 00:08:54.000
I mean, this is Manabi we're talking about,

00:08:53.060 --> 00:08:54.360
Batting fourth,

00:08:54.000 --> 00:08:56.370
so she might not have anything thought out.

00:08:54.360 --> 00:08:55.550
the pitcher,

00:08:55.740 --> 00:08:56.840
Honami-kun.

00:08:56.940 --> 00:08:58.310
Hey Mu-chi.

00:08:57.650 --> 00:08:58.900
At second...

00:09:00.800 --> 00:09:04.040
About your softball tournament,

00:09:04.040 --> 00:09:05.670
how did that go?

00:09:05.670 --> 00:09:07.560
Ah, that.

00:09:07.560 --> 00:09:08.650
We lost.

00:09:11.220 --> 00:09:12.440
I see...

00:09:12.830 --> 00:09:15.220
Hey, we did our best.

00:09:15.220 --> 00:09:17.460
It happens in this type of competition.

00:09:24.540 --> 00:09:25.300
A miss...

00:09:26.760 --> 00:09:28.140
See 'ya later.

00:09:34.790 --> 00:09:37.230
If only I had been paying attention...

00:09:47.360 --> 00:09:48.950
Yet, I...

00:10:31.680 --> 00:10:32.320
Hi there.

00:10:41.250 --> 00:10:43.050
All right!

00:10:43.050 --> 00:10:43.890
Did you see!

00:10:45.890 --> 00:10:47.720
All right!

00:10:47.110 --> 00:10:48.160
All right!

00:10:48.160 --> 00:10:48.970
Yeah!

00:10:48.970 --> 00:10:50.180
All right!

00:10:58.390 --> 00:10:59.910
But man...

00:10:59.910 --> 00:11:05.640
I thought it was a standard thing for new students to be getting a bunch of "join our club" solicitations.

00:11:05.640 --> 00:11:06.540
Yeah.

00:11:06.540 --> 00:11:08.300
Man, how boring.

00:11:08.780 --> 00:11:09.600
Yeah.

00:11:11.220 --> 00:11:13.250
What'd they call you in middle school?

00:11:13.250 --> 00:11:14.430
Mikan.

00:11:14.430 --> 00:11:15.780
Hmm...

00:11:16.970 --> 00:11:19.360
Hey, can I call you Mikan, too?

00:11:19.360 --> 00:11:20.170
Oh, sure.

00:11:22.100 --> 00:11:24.600
Then, you can call me Mu-chi.

00:11:25.300 --> 00:11:26.110
Okay.

00:11:50.750 --> 00:11:52.510
Give it back, Uehara-san!

00:11:52.510 --> 00:11:54.580
Like I'm going to give it back when you're calling me that.

00:11:54.880 --> 00:11:56.160
Umm...

00:11:56.640 --> 00:11:58.080
Mu... Mu-chi!

00:12:09.190 --> 00:12:12.260
The memory of our first meeting under the falling cherry blossoms,

00:12:12.630 --> 00:12:14.890
and the memory that was lost in the sound of the rain.

00:12:22.200 --> 00:12:24.670
And... you're here to study?

00:12:24.670 --> 00:12:25.280
Yeah.

00:12:25.660 --> 00:12:26.530
Starting now?

00:12:26.850 --> 00:12:27.640
Yeah.

00:12:33.980 --> 00:12:35.320
Sure, I guess.

00:12:36.000 --> 00:12:37.810
Coming in!

00:12:45.000 --> 00:12:47.500
It's amazing every time I see this scene.

00:12:48.050 --> 00:12:50.290
Sorry, I'll get them out right away.

00:12:50.290 --> 00:12:52.150
Ah, no, it's okay-

00:12:52.150 --> 00:12:54.980
Mika-chan, how've you been doing?

00:12:54.980 --> 00:12:57.510
Hey, hey, don't call her by her name, or I'll kill you.

00:12:59.510 --> 00:13:02.240
Owww!!

00:13:02.380 --> 00:13:03.590
Stupid Mutsuki.

00:13:03.590 --> 00:13:05.910
Watch where you're stepping.

00:13:05.910 --> 00:13:07.520
No, you clean things up first!

00:13:07.760 --> 00:13:10.100
I'm not the one that put it there.

00:13:10.100 --> 00:13:11.590
No, that's not the point-

00:13:11.590 --> 00:13:12.690
Hey, don't spill the juice!

00:13:12.950 --> 00:13:14.240
Gah... Tissues!

00:13:14.240 --> 00:13:15.390
Tissues, tissues, tissues!

00:13:15.390 --> 00:13:17.820
Hey, don't turn on the TV!

00:13:17.820 --> 00:13:19.450
We're going to start studying now!

00:13:19.950 --> 00:13:21.120
Go ahead.

00:13:21.120 --> 00:13:22.790
What do you mean "go ahead"?!

00:13:22.790 --> 00:13:24.060
And then, Mika,

00:13:24.060 --> 00:13:25.960
press here and-

00:13:24.670 --> 00:13:25.960
Stop calling her by her first name!

00:13:26.750 --> 00:13:28.670
Hey, what're you doing?!

00:13:30.090 --> 00:13:31.710
Why you...

00:13:36.220 --> 00:13:37.720
Here, I'll let you play.

00:13:37.720 --> 00:13:40.710
Hey, what do you think you're doing?!

00:13:42.260 --> 00:13:43.260
Hey!

00:13:44.690 --> 00:13:46.640
God, stop crying, stop crying!

00:13:47.010 --> 00:13:49.260
You're pretty good! Go! Go!

00:13:51.480 --> 00:13:54.070
You guys, listen to me!!

00:13:58.850 --> 00:14:01.760
Really, enough of this!

00:14:02.360 --> 00:14:05.790
Aren't you guys ashamed of yourselves when we have a guest with us?

00:14:05.790 --> 00:14:07.640
You're the one that should be ashamed, Nee-chan.

00:14:07.640 --> 00:14:08.820
Say what?!

00:14:07.980 --> 00:14:09.960
Nee-chan, I need to pee...

00:14:10.020 --> 00:14:11.240
Hold it!

00:14:11.240 --> 00:14:13.150
No, it's okay, it's okay.

00:14:13.150 --> 00:14:14.400
I don't really mind.

00:14:14.400 --> 00:14:15.400
I really don't.

00:14:15.400 --> 00:14:16.260
But!

00:14:16.930 --> 00:14:20.550
Having it all lively like this makes it feel less lonely around here.

00:14:20.550 --> 00:14:22.500
You think so?

00:14:22.500 --> 00:14:24.110
Sorry for all this.

00:14:24.470 --> 00:14:26.190
Yeah, I really don't mind.

00:14:26.190 --> 00:14:27.180
Let's start.

00:14:27.180 --> 00:14:27.770
Yeah.

00:14:31.920 --> 00:14:34.770
You know, for the parts that'll be tested on tomorrow's exam-

00:14:37.000 --> 00:14:39.330
Yeah, the exam's-

00:14:39.730 --> 00:14:40.990
The exam's-

00:14:49.040 --> 00:14:51.400
You guys... get out...

00:14:52.420 --> 00:14:55.920
Please teach her what you can, Mika-chan.

00:14:56.170 --> 00:14:57.200
I will.

00:14:58.010 --> 00:14:59.590
What's there to teach?

00:14:59.590 --> 00:15:02.440
Our brains are at the same level.

00:15:02.440 --> 00:15:04.960
You think so?

00:15:09.950 --> 00:15:10.810
Then...

00:15:12.690 --> 00:15:13.440
It's a showdown!

00:15:13.440 --> 00:15:14.720
You got it!

00:15:26.940 --> 00:15:28.460
Let's take a break.

00:15:29.390 --> 00:15:30.870
You're right.

00:15:44.710 --> 00:15:46.250
Are you sure this is okay?

00:15:46.590 --> 00:15:48.140
It'll be fine.

00:16:01.210 --> 00:16:04.320
Damn, we're heroes, yo, heroes.

00:16:07.290 --> 00:16:09.130
On the night before the exams,

00:16:09.130 --> 00:16:11.750
we're eating donuts and drinking caffe-lattes without any books.

00:16:13.170 --> 00:16:14.840
Heroes, heroes!

00:16:16.930 --> 00:16:17.980
Oh, yeah.

00:16:17.980 --> 00:16:20.110
About the School Fair-

00:16:20.970 --> 00:16:23.750
No talk about the School Fair tonight!

00:16:23.750 --> 00:16:24.760
Why's that?

00:16:24.760 --> 00:16:25.870
It doesn't matter.

00:16:25.870 --> 00:16:27.240
Well, why?

00:16:27.770 --> 00:16:29.180
Well, it doesn't matter.

00:16:30.750 --> 00:16:31.910
Okay, then.

00:16:31.910 --> 00:16:34.580
Let's talk about baseball, then, baseball!

00:16:34.580 --> 00:16:35.800
N-No baseball either!

00:16:35.930 --> 00:16:37.610
Why?!

00:16:37.610 --> 00:16:39.750
Because I don't understand it.

00:16:40.070 --> 00:16:42.280
Then, fighting!

00:16:42.280 --> 00:16:44.070
N-No, no!

00:16:44.070 --> 00:16:45.220
Then, pro wrestling!

00:16:45.220 --> 00:16:47.320
That's the same thing as fighting.

00:16:47.320 --> 00:16:48.120
Soccer!

00:16:48.120 --> 00:16:50.280
I don't get it because the rules are too hard.

00:16:50.500 --> 00:16:51.640
Then...

00:16:51.640 --> 00:16:54.340
Our interests don't really match up, do they?

00:16:54.340 --> 00:16:55.400
Well...

00:16:55.400 --> 00:16:57.830
Why are we friends?

00:16:58.440 --> 00:17:00.460
We're weird.

00:17:00.460 --> 00:17:01.750
We are.

00:17:11.010 --> 00:17:12.050
Hey, hey-

00:19:08.400 --> 00:19:09.800
What's this? What's this?

00:19:10.020 --> 00:19:12.030
At least, turn the lights on.

00:19:12.030 --> 00:19:13.410
Mu-chi.

00:19:16.300 --> 00:19:19.130
I'm all alone now.

00:19:20.470 --> 00:19:22.060
You crybaby.

00:19:23.750 --> 00:19:24.570
This is cold.

00:19:26.430 --> 00:19:28.240
Mu-chi, what happened?

00:19:31.430 --> 00:19:34.420
I asked a few people that were around.

00:19:34.420 --> 00:19:35.770
They said no.

00:19:36.480 --> 00:19:37.830
Mu-chi...

00:19:37.830 --> 00:19:40.580
I think the Student Council is a nice place.

00:19:41.380 --> 00:19:43.730
Let's end here for today.

00:19:43.730 --> 00:19:45.820
I'll ask some more people tomorrow.

00:19:48.670 --> 00:19:50.050
Ah, don't-

00:19:54.470 --> 00:19:55.510
You'll get wet.

00:20:09.410 --> 00:20:10.580
Crybaby.

00:20:16.250 --> 00:20:18.320
Don't turn it over yet, okay?

00:20:18.620 --> 00:20:22.080
I beg you, I beg you, I beg you, I beg you...

00:20:22.080 --> 00:20:23.870
Okay... begin!

00:20:31.010 --> 00:20:34.470
And I completely bombed the last exam, too.

00:20:35.550 --> 00:20:36.420
But...

00:20:38.140 --> 00:20:39.040
And with this,

00:20:39.040 --> 00:20:42.360
I declare all Student Council work before the summer vacation complete!

00:20:44.160 --> 00:20:46.740
It may be over, but don't let your intensity slacken.

00:20:47.040 --> 00:20:49.970
During summer vacation,
we'll be gathering once a week...

00:20:49.970 --> 00:20:52.170
...to periodically prepare for the School Fair-

00:20:52.170 --> 00:20:52.900
And so today,

00:20:52.900 --> 00:20:56.150
I'd like to do a "Job Well Done" party.

00:20:53.030 --> 00:20:53.760
Listen to me.

00:20:58.240 --> 00:21:00.330
A gift from Shimojii!

00:21:00.330 --> 00:21:02.390
Oh, so bright!

00:21:02.390 --> 00:21:05.750
The Miss Donut in front of the train station lets us refill our caffe-lattes unlimited times,

00:21:05.750 --> 00:21:06.790
so how about we go there?

00:21:06.790 --> 00:21:08.150
Eh....

00:21:08.790 --> 00:21:11.010
Not Miss Donut...

00:21:11.010 --> 00:21:12.050
Right?

00:21:13.550 --> 00:21:14.910
How come? How come?

00:21:17.330 --> 00:21:18.260
It doesn't matter!

00:21:23.980 --> 00:21:24.730
But...

00:21:29.440 --> 00:21:30.580
Come on, we're going.

00:21:30.580 --> 00:21:32.350
Ah, w-wait!

00:21:59.260 --> 00:22:01.970
...I'm very happy right now.

00:22:12.000 --> 00:22:17.300
We're still at the very beginning of things.

00:22:19.190 --> 00:22:24.050
Even the thousand-mile road starts with a first step.

00:22:26.660 --> 00:22:30.980
There's a first time for everyone,

00:22:31.190 --> 00:22:38.520
so take it on fearlessly - that's the best way to go

00:22:40.840 --> 00:22:47.800
I'm glad I chose a path I love,

00:22:48.000 --> 00:22:55.010
so thank you, God.

00:22:57.820 --> 00:23:03.310
I want to treasure my luck right now

00:23:03.530 --> 00:23:06.610
And stay happy on the way.

00:23:06.810 --> 00:23:10.450
Come on, let's ride on the momentum

00:23:10.710 --> 00:23:13.240
Bang！Bang！Bang！

00:23:13.300 --> 00:23:15.410
That's right, Lucky!

00:23:15.450 --> 00:23:19.000
Now is the time, happy!

00:23:19.060 --> 00:23:22.130
Grab your chances

00:23:22.210 --> 00:23:27.300
And live your lives to the fullest...
